{
  "id": "JHN.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Joani 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela hayumiyi, Yesu hakwenda muŊaliliya; walekeli kwenda muYudeya muloŋa aYudeya akeŋeli kumujaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu chawija chawaYudeya chamuyisolu chashika dehi kwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ana kwindi hiyakumwila nawu, Fumaku kunu, yaloŋa kweyi muYudeya kulonda atumbanji tweyi niwena akamoni nyidimu yeyi yiwelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakeŋa a kutiyakana, helilaŋa yuma kumbaduku. Neyi eyi welaŋa yumiyi, kadimwekeshi eyi aweni kudi antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hela ana kwindi niwena hiyamwitiyiluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yesu hakuyila nindi, Mpinji yami kanda yishiki; hakwila enu mpinji jejima jenu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ampata yamunu mwishina hiyanatweshi kuyihela enuku; hakwila ami anhelaŋa, muloŋa yami nayishimunaŋa nami nyidimu yawu yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu kwenu yenu kuchawija, ami kwami kukanduka kuchawija chi kanda, muloŋa mpinji yami kanda yishiki chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanayilejiyi yumiyi hakushakama tuhu muŊaliliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanakandukuwu ana kwindi kuchawija, niyena nawa hakuya kwenoku; hayili hatookaku, ilaŋa chakumbadi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi aYudeya hiyakumukeŋakeŋa kuchawija, nawu, Wudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamazaza awantu hadiŋi kumunyinyita nankashi; amunawu, Himuntumuwahi; amakwawu nawu, Nehi, wudi nakuluwisha antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, hikwadiŋi muntu wamuteneni hatookaku, nawoma wawaYudeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chihanashiki hakachi kachawija, Yesu hakukanduka ayi mutembeli, hakuleja antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi aYudeya hiyakuhayama nawu, Muntu iwu neluki ŋahi kutaŋa chakadi kudiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yesu hakuyakula nindi, Kuleja kwami hikwamami awenuku, kwambala kwayena wantemesheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kudi muntu nakeŋi kwila mwaya muchima windi, wakeluka kulejiku, neyi kunafumi kudi Nzambi, hela neyi nahoshi chakumuchima wamami aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahoshaŋa chakumuchima windi yomweni, diyi walondaŋa kudilemesha yomwenindi; ilaŋa iwu wakeŋa aŋa kulemesha wamutemesheli, diyi walala, mudi yena himwekala kuheŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wayinkeli nshimbi, ilaŋa hikwekala mwinenu welaŋa nshimbuku. Mudi nakukeŋa kunjahiladi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izaza hidikumwakula nawu, Eyi wudi nademoni. Anakeŋi kukujaha kudinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu liakuyakula nindi, Nela mudimu wumu, himukuhayama wejima wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chayinkeliyi Mosi kwalama; hichafumini kudi Mosuku, chafumini kudi ankakulula; mwalamishaŋa ntu hasabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu amwalamisha hasabata kulonda nshimbi jaMosi abuli kujimotoka, indi enu muzuwaŋa nanami nanichi chinakoleshi muntu hasabata ngu chikupu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi musompeshaŋa chakumesuku, chiŋa musompeshaŋa kusompesha kwaloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi antu akuYerusalema amakwawu hiyakwila nawu, Hidiyi adi nakukeŋa kujahawuku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwu wukuhosha hatooka iwu; izunidimu dakumwilawu kwosi. Anyuli aneluki dehi chalala nawu diyi Kristu, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila etu tuneluki kwafumayi iwu iyala. Chamba kenzayi Kristu hikwakekala muntu wakeluka kwakufumayuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yesu hakubidika mutembeli, iku wudi nakuleja antu, nindi, Mwaŋiluka, mweluka nikunafumini. Ami hinadinjila ami awenuku, ilaŋa yena wantemesheli diyi walala, himwamwilukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami namwiluka, muloŋa diku nafumini, yena diyi wantemesheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hiyakukeŋa kumukwata, ilaŋa hikwadiŋi muntu wakumwolwela chikasaku, muloŋa henohu mpinji yindi kanda yishiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ntu amwizaza amavulu hiyakumwitiya, nawu, Chakenzayi Kristu, wakela yinjikijilu yakubadika yaneliyi iwu iyala, tahindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AFwarisi hiyakutiya mwadiŋi nakumunyinyita izaza. Akulumpi jawatupristu niaFwarisi atemesha niatulama amukwati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yesu hakwila nindi, Nichidi nanenu mafuku antesha, hinakaya kudi yena wantemesheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakankeŋakeŋa, kunwananehi; ikukunakekalami, himwakatwesha hushika kwoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYudeya hiyakuhosha mukachi kawu, nawu, Iyaliwu keŋa ayi kudihi kutukubula kumuwana? Wukuya kudi aYudeya amakwawu apalaŋana dehi mukachi kawaHeleni nakuleja aHeleni, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idi izu danahoshiyi dakwila nindi, Mwakankeŋakeŋa, kunwana nehi; iku kunakekalami, himwakatwesha kushika kwoku; daya mudihi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dakukuminina, dodifuku dalemena chawija, Yesu hakwimana nakubidika, nindi, Neyi kudi muntu natiyi mpwila, enzi kudami anwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukunkuhwelela, mumuchima windi mukufumaŋa tuloŋa twameji amomi, mwomunahoshi mukanda wajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chahosheliyi ochu wateneni Spiritu, akukeŋa kutambulawu antu akumwitiya chakukuhwelela; henohu Spiritu wuchidi kanda enzi, muloŋa Yesu wuchidi kanda amulemeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu amwizaza chatiyiluwu mazu owu hiyakwila nawu, Chalala diyi owu kaprofwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu nawu, Diyi Kristu. Ilaŋa makwawu nawu, Aka! Kristu afumi muŊaliliya, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanda wajila wunahoshi nawu, Kristu wukufuma kumutaŋa waDavidi, nikuBetelemi, mukala wadiŋi Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izaza dambuka nihansaŋu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu akeŋeli nawu amukwati; ilaŋa hikwadiŋi muntu wakumwolwela makasaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulama hiyakufunta kudi awakulumpi jawatupristu nawaFwarisi; wena hiyakuyihula nawu, Munabulilidi kumuleta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulama hiyakwakula nawu, Hikudi muntu wahoshahu dehi neyi iwuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka aFwarisi nawu, Ninenu nawa anayidimbi dehi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunamwekani nyuli wumu hela kaFwarisi namwitiyi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ntu awa amavulu anabuli kwiluka nshimbi ashiŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikodemu, owu wenjili dehi kudi Yesu, wadiŋi mwinawu niyena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakuyila nindi, Nshimbi jetu jasompeshaŋa muntu chakadi kusambila kutiya mwakuhoshayi yomweni, hela kwiluka mwakwilayi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakumwakula nawu, Komana nineyi nawa wumuntu wakuHaliliya, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talatalaku munyikanda yajila, wiluki kuŊaliliya hikwafumana kaprofwetuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
